<v Ira Glass>Seth Lind is our operations director. Emily Condon's our production manager. Elise Bergerson's our business manager. Kimberly Henderson is our office coordinator. Old Japanese TV footage in today's show comes from NHK in Tokyo. Thanks to [INAUDIBLE], who translated it for us.
<v Ira Glass>塞斯·林德是我们的运营总监。艾米丽·康登是我们的制片经理。埃利斯·伯格森是我们的商务经理。金伯利·亨德森是我们的办公室协调员。今天节目中旧的日本电视录像来自东京NHK。感谢[听不清]为我们翻译了它。

01:02:14.970 --> 01:02:44.530
