01:04:04.010 --> 01:04:12.420
<v Ira Glass>Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. You know, I overheard him in the hallway, telling somebody how surprised he was about the quality of our programs this past year.
<v Ira Glass>像往常一样，感谢我们节目的联合创始人，托雷·马拉蒂亚先生。你知道，我在走廊里无意中听到他告诉某人，他对过去一年我们节目的质量感到多么惊讶。

01:04:12.420 --> 01:04:17.270
<v Bruce Lee>Because that was not a young workforce. And, you know, they were old. They were fat.
<v Bruce Lee>因为那不是一支年轻的劳动力队伍。而且，你知道，他们老了。他们胖了。

01:04:17.270 --> 01:04:22.270
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。
